	(text "Pin map DERIVED from ST pin data in the KiCad STM32WBA55CGUx symbol; CONFIRM IN STM32CubeMX before layout freeze.\nEncoder on TIM2 CH1/CH2 (PB6/PA8) - TIM2 width must be confirmed in RM0493 (CF-21/FW-08).\nSPI3 -> PMD401 (mode 3, <= 500 kbit/s, PMD401 manual 150025-01 sec.5.2). USART2 + DE -> MAX3485. LPUART1 <-> supervisor link.\nUSART1 TX-only console (PA8, the only USART1_RX pin, carries the encoder).\nECO1: supplies per DS14127 Figure 15 (SMPS scheme), AN6373 and MB1803 B-01. VDDRFPA on the SMPS output limits TX to about +3 dBm (AN6373 sec.7);\nfor +10 dBm fit R513 and remove FB502. RF: MLPF-WB-04D3 with a 63 ohm line from pin 37 and a 50 ohm line to J501. HSE and LSE per AN5948 Table 5."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 15 20 0)
		(effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top))
		(uuid "9b397ab0-2a19-5949-a857-30056a2cfea7")
